WEBVTT

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
axir oramizdagi

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
tubsiz bo'shliqchi?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Biz shunday kutib yuraveramizmi?

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Bu yerda hech narsani ko'rib bo'lmaydi

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Belgilar boshqa tomonga qaraydi

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Biz esa yerga mixlangan kabi

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.000
parcha-parcha bo'lib

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
bukilib, toliqqan yuzlarimiz